+# the common completed value verdict, like native/retained expression typing.
+# Only another expression shape uses the literal/Frame reader. A failed root
+# never retries namespace classification in a receiving or emission consumer.
+fn: l2_colon_field_ty (@: LmP0Field field; int: mi; @: int out_ty) int
+    L2ValueSpan: value
+    int: status
